     "source": "stock"
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "search": [
      "coral reef limestone"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "search": [
      "frigatebird Nauru",
      "seabird colony Pacific"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "say": "The way they found it sounds made up. Around nineteen hundred, a man named Albert Ellis was working for a mining company in Sydney.",
   "visuals": [
    {
     "type": "date",
