     ]
    }
   ],
   "pops": [
    {
     "text": "HAMMER DEROBURT",
     "label": "first president of Nauru",
     "on": "Hammer",
     "kind": "person"
    }
   ],
   "date": "1968"
  },
  {
   "say": "Two years later, they took the mines for themselves. Every ton of phosphate now made money for Nauru.",
   "visuals": [
    {
     "type": "image",
     "search": [
      "Nauru Phosphate Corporation"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "search": [
      "Nauru phosphate cantilever Aiwo"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "date": "1970"
  },
  {
   "say": "And the money came in like a flood.",
   "visuals": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "lines": [
      "And then...",
      "the money came."
     ],
     "hit": true
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "say": "By the late nineteen seventies, the income for each Nauruan was among the very highest in the world. Richer, per person, than Americans.",
   "visuals": [
    {
     "type": "stat",
     "number": 1.7,
     "suffix": " BILLION",
     "label": "at its peak, the island's trust fund (Australian dollars)",
