    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "say": "For a few years, a tiny island in the middle of nowhere looked like the luckiest place on Earth.",
   "visuals": [
    {
     "type": "video",
     "search": [
      "tropical beach palm trees sunset"
     ],
     "source": "stock"
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "search": [
      "Nauru beach Anibare"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "say": "But there were two problems nobody wanted to talk about.",
   "visuals": [
    {
     "type": "type",
     "text": "TWO PROBLEMS"
    }
   ],
   "chapter": "The price",
   "mood": "tense"
  },
  {
   "say": "The first was the island itself. To get the phosphate, the miners stripped away everything. Trees. Soil. Homes. Gardens.",
   "visuals": [
    {
     "type": "image",
     "search": [
      "Nauru topside mining landscape"
