     "on": "Hundreds",
     "kind": "money"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "say": "In the late nineties, money from Russia began pouring through them. Russian officials later estimated that around seventy billion dollars passed through Nauru's banks in nineteen ninety eight alone.",
