     "text": "MV TAMPA",
     "label": "more than 400 people rescued",
     "on": "Tampa",
     "kind": "place"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "say": "Instead, Australia paid Nauru to hold them. Tents and fences went up on the old mining land.",
